# Cogkura agent core

- Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before making structural or API changes.
- After substantive edits under `src/`, `tests/`, `examples/`, or `pyproject.toml`, run CI-equivalent checks:
  `uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check . && uv run mypy src && uv run pytest`
- Prefer surgical edits. Do not rewrite README, examples, or docs wholesale unless asked.
- When editing docs/examples, preserve useful content (positioning sections, tags, second examples, contributing/build notes) unless the user explicitly removes it.
- Before large doc rewrites, compare with `git show HEAD:<path>` or the prior file content.
- Do not commit or push unless the user asks.
- Core stays dependency-free; Postgres only behind `cogkura[postgres]`.
